WEBVTT

00:10:58.362 --> 00:11:01.907
to convene pastors, police chiefs
and business owners

00:11:01.907 --> 00:11:04.410
to create a unity alliance
around immigration

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.078
in conservative southern Idaho.

00:11:06.745 --> 00:11:10.332
Across the country, you have conservative
and moderate evangelical women

00:11:10.332 --> 00:11:13.752
working together
to welcome Afghan families

00:11:13.752 --> 00:11:16.130
into their communities,
into their churches.

00:11:16.171 --> 00:11:19.508
But more than that,
these women are sitting together

00:11:19.508 --> 00:11:21.385
to return to their Bible

00:11:21.385 --> 00:11:23.387
and ask themselves the question,

00:11:23.429 --> 00:11:26.014
"How do I truly welcome this stranger?"

00:11:27.933 --> 00:11:30.853
In the past, I would have said
that these are unlikely allies,